源自 06131; 專有名詞 地名

欽定本 - Ekron 22; 22

以革倫 = "移民" 或 "連根拔起"
1) 非利士人的五個主要城市中之最北;
   位於猶太低地, 後來被 "但" 佔有

record.edic_text:
06138 `Eqrown {ek-rone'}

from 06131;; n pr loc

AV - Ekron 22; 22

Ekron = "emigration" or "torn up by the roots"
1) the most northerly of the 5 principal cities of the Philistines;
   located in the lowlands of Judah and later given to Dan
